    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a test message from the LU-Alert national warning and information system. No action is required on your part. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the event of real danger, you would have received a message such as:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Ongoing police operation in Esch-Belval.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Please avoid the area as much as possible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Please follow the instructions of the emergency services on site.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More information on the LU-Alert website.&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
